sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Admin as 管理员
    participant KC as KnowledgeDocumentController
    participant KS as KnowledgeDocumentServiceImpl
    participant OS as FileStorageService
    participant PR as ParserRegistry
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant MQP as MessageQueueProducer
    participant MQ as RocketMQ
    participant CC as KnowledgeDocumentChunkConsumer
    participant IK as DefaultIngestionKernel
    participant PE as Parser/Chunk/Embedding
    participant IW as ChunkIndexWriter

    Admin->>KC: POST /knowledge-base/{kb-id}/docs/upload
    KC->>KS: upload(kbId, request, file)
    KS->>KS: 校验知识库、来源、调度、摄取规格
    KS->>OS: 保存原文件
    OS-->>KS: StoredFileDTO(url, mime, size)
    KS->>PR: canParse(mime)
    alt MIME 不支持
        KS->>OS: deleteByUrl(url)
        KS-->>Admin: ClientException
    else MIME 支持
        KS->>DB: INSERT document(status=PENDING)
        KS-->>Admin: KnowledgeDocumentVO
    end

    Note over Admin,DB: 上传成功只证明原文件与文档元数据存在，不证明已经可检索

    Admin->>KC: POST /knowledge-base/docs/{doc-id}/chunk
    KC->>KS: startChunk(docId)
    KS->>MQP: sendInTransaction(event)
    MQP->>DB: 条件更新 document=RUNNING<br/>并 upsert schedule
    alt 文档已经 RUNNING
        DB-->>Admin: 拒绝重复启动
    else 本地事务提交
        MQP->>MQ: KnowledgeDocumentChunkEvent
        KC-->>Admin: Result.success
    end

    MQ->>CC: onMessage(event)
    CC->>KS: executeChunk(docId)
    KS->>DB: INSERT chunk_log(RUNNING)
    alt ProcessMode.PIPELINE
        KS->>DB: document=FAILED<br/>chunk_log=FAILED
        Note over KS: 当前显式失败：管道模式重构中
    else 直接分块
        KS->>OS: openStream(fileUrl)
        OS-->>KS: bytes
        KS->>IK: run(doc, bytes, spec, target)
        IK->>PE: MIME detect → parseStructured<br/>→ chunk → embed
        PE-->>IK: EmbeddedChunk list
        IK->>IW: replaceDocument(target, doc, chunks)
        IW->>DB: 关系 Chunk + pgvector 默认落点
        IW-->>IK: replace complete
        IK-->>KS: IngestionOutcome + timings
        alt 成功
            KS->>DB: document=SUCCESS<br/>mime + chunkCount
            KS->>DB: chunk_log=SUCCESS + timings
        else 任一步骤异常
            KS->>DB: document=FAILED
            KS->>DB: chunk_log=FAILED + error
        end
    end

    Note over KS,IW: 数据库终态、远端派生索引和真实召回仍要分别验证
